<view class="page"><view class="title">日记相册</view><view class="muted">只展示你自己的日记照片，点击可放大查看。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button bindtap="refresh">重试</button></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{busy}}">正在读取照片…</view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!busy && !photos.length}}">还没有照片，在写日记时添加吧。</view><view class="grid"><image wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="*this" class="photo" mode="aspectFill" src="{{item}}" data-url="{{item}}" bindtap="preview"/></view></view>
